Z||000003||Philphine||07-27-2000||10:17 AM||||i feel it coming.<P>my brother says when i leave for work a few times he's  found people in the back yard "just looking" at my cars. there are a couple of things that happen then. <P>maybe someone called the authorities on them for cars they had so they call on me. i guess because they think i should get what they got.<P>or, some one wants a car i have so they call so i have to move the cars. as soon as i get the notice one of these people show up with an offer to buy a car i have.<P>so far no ones just up a stole a car or anything off one but it wouldn't surprise me much.<P>7, the fact that you can keep that many in an apartment i find surprising. i envy you more for the fact you can keep them more than that you have them.||||reg||1
